; Who may ring the Judicom: one 10-digit number per line.  Copy to judicom-allowed.conf on the NAS and put the real numbers in.
; Keep it in step with /home/joe/contacts.txt on the Judicom (that file puts the names on the screen).
; The real file is not kept in git (the repository is public).  After a change:  asterisk -rx "dialplan reload"
[judicom-allowed]
